          "guid": "mt0torrje9681ht8",
          "message": {
            "text": "The native three-platform matrix deliberately uploads evidence instead of copying the macOS envelope to Linux and Windows. The local expanded probe already found a zoom-dependent outline edge shift reproduced at DSF 1 and 2; that logical finding is isolated in DM-2323, while these artifacts provide the fingerprints needed to ratify future platform envelopes.",
            "markdown": "The native three-platform matrix deliberately uploads evidence instead of copying the macOS envelope to Linux and Windows. The local expanded probe already found a zoom-dependent outline edge shift reproduced at DSF 1 and 2; that logical finding is isolated in DM-2323, while these artifacts provide the fingerprints needed to ratify future platform envelopes."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": ".github/workflows/border-phase-oracle.yml"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 13,
                  "endLine": 37,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "jobs:\n  matrix:\n    strategy:\n      fail-fast: false\n      matrix:\n        os: [macos-latest, ubuntu-latest, windows-latest]\n    runs-on: ${{ matrix.os }}\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n        with: { node-version: '${{ env.NODE_VERSION }}', cache: npm }\n      - run: npm ci\n      - run: npx playwright install chromium\n      - name: Run zoom and device-scale matrix\n        run: npm run borders:phase-oracle -- --dsf 1,2,4 --zoom 0.8,1,1.25 --report-only --json tests/output/border-phase/report.json --keep tests/output/border-phase/artifacts\n      - name: Record runner environment\n        if: always()\n        run: node scripts/run-env.mjs tests/output/border-phase/run-env.json\n      - name: Upload fingerprinted report and visual evidence\n        if: always()\n        uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4\n        with:\n          name: border-phase-${{ runner.os }}\n          path: tests/output/border-phase/\n          if-no-files-found: error"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
